  "body_html": "<p>Embrace your passion for baseball with this dynamic Jeminise Comforter Set, perfect for adding a personalized touch to any sports enthusiast's bedroom. Designed for comfort and style, this bedding set celebrates the spirit of the game with a custom design.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin, US Full, US Queen, and US King to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing Process:</strong> Environmentally friendly finishing prevents dye fading, ensuring long-lasting vibrancy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric with Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling for a soft, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and suitable for air drying without heat, making maintenance simple.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Features text input for personalization, allowing for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design Theme:</strong> Showcases a vibrant Baseball Thunder pattern with a Fire Baseball Player design.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Set Name</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<th>Number of Items</th>\n<td>1</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n</table>",
